---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/brand/logo.png" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#b9e4fa" />
</head>
<main class="grid min-h-screen place-items-center bg-parchment p-6 text-ink">
  <section class="w-full max-w-xl rounded-card border border-mist bg-white p-8 sm:p-12">
    <img class="size-16 object-contain" src="/assets/brand/logo.png" alt="Profitable Educators Nexus" />
    <p class="eyebrow mt-8">Payment received</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-4 text-5xl sm:text-6xl">Thank you — your next chapter starts here.</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-stone">You’re one step closer to joining Thrivers. Here’s what happens next.</p>
    <div class="my-7 rounded-card border border-mist bg-parchment p-5"><h2 class="font-medium">Next steps</h2><ol class="mt-2 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone"><li>Send us a screenshot of this payment confirmation using the form below.</li><li>We will confirm and add you to the private Thrivers group.</li><li>You will receive your welcome pack and first session details.</li></ol></div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="btn btn-wine" href="https://forms.gle/A232tyGxm3uU6G98" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Email your screenshot ↗</a><a class="btn btn-lilac" href="/">Back to homepage</a></div>
  </section>
</main>
